/**
 * Nova Residence - CGI villa tour (?scene=villa).
 *
 * Equirectangular panoramas baked in Blender/Cycles (OptiX) from the licensed
 * "Classic Villa 2021" project - three vantage points (pool/garden exterior,
 * open-plan kitchen, bedroom/lounge), each in two REAL rendered lighting
 * states (the picker swaps the actual panorama, not a CSS tint):
 *
 *   ☀️ Day   - daylight (default)
 *   🌙 Night - lamplit interiors, glowing pool, lit windows
 *
 * These are TRUE rendered states of one consistent 3D scene - not stock
 * photos. Hotspots teleport between vantage points; the interiors default to
 * looking slightly down so the room (not the ceiling) fills the first view.
 *
 * Panoramas live in `apps/viewer/public/panoramas/villa-*.jpg`.
 */

